title: "Tees Valley VCSE Sector Size (based-in) - a weekly time series"
abstract: "A living, weekly-updated time series of registered VCSE organisations based in each Tees Valley local authority (charities, CIOs, CICs, registered societies and CASCs), built from Find That Charity using the registered-office (based-in) rule."
type: dataset
